{#
  FOLDER — Figma 918:32037 / 1194:17746 (Tools), 1190:16880 / 1194:17745
  (Services). Expects `folder` from home.about.folders.

  LAYERED, SO THE CONTENTS CAN MOVE. Back to front:
    back      the dark folder (exported SVG)
    sheet     the grey page inside
    card      Tools only: the white sheet the icons sit on while closed
    items     the icons, or the text cards
    front     the frosted flap: a real backdrop blur (the comp's 45.7 radius
              background blur), clipped to the flap's outline, with the
              exported SVG on top for its tint and inner highlight

  Closed, the items sit inside, behind the flap, so the blur softens them.
  Opening (click; scripts/v4-folders.js) lifts the items above the flap and
  slides each to its open position, a few ms apart; closing puts them back
  and only then drops them behind the flap again. Positions come from the
  data as centres (icons) or corners (cards), closed and open.

  AT REST, THE COMP'S OWN RENDER. A browser's backdrop blur cannot match
  Figma's (softer, with grain, and it samples the page around the flap), so
  the closed folder shows the comp's exported image on top of the layers, and
  it is pixel-exact. On open it hands over at once to the layers as they start
  to move; on close it comes back only once they are all home.

  It is a real <button> with aria-expanded, so it works from the keyboard.
#}
<figure class="v4-about__card">
  <button class="v4-folder v4-folder--{{ folder.id }}" type="button" data-folder aria-expanded="false"
          aria-label="{{ folder.label }}: open the folder"
          style="--w: {{ folder.width }}px">
    <img class="v4-folder__back" src="{{ folder.back }}" alt="" />
    <span class="v4-folder__sheet{% if folder.sheet.stays %} v4-folder__sheet--stays{% endif %}"
          style="left: {{ folder.sheet.x }}px; top: {{ folder.sheet.y }}px; width: {{ folder.sheet.w }}px; height: {{ folder.sheet.h }}px"></span>
    {%- if folder.card %}
    <span class="v4-folder__card" style="left: {{ folder.card.x }}px; top: {{ folder.card.y }}px; width: {{ folder.card.w }}px; height: {{ folder.card.h }}px"></span>
    {%- endif %}

    <span class="v4-folder__items"{% if folder.card %} style="--clip: {{ folder.card.y }}px {{ folder.width - folder.card.x - folder.card.w }}px {{ 195 - folder.card.y - folder.card.h }}px {{ folder.card.x }}px"{% endif %}>
      {%- for icon in folder.icons %}
      <img class="v4-folder__item v4-folder__icon" src="/Assets/v4/about/folders/icon-{{ icon.src }}.svg" alt="{{ icon.name }}"
           width="{{ icon.size }}" height="{{ icon.size }}"
           style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}; --s: {{ icon.size }}px; --fx: {{ icon.from[0] }}px; --fy: {{ icon.from[1] }}px; --tx: {{ icon.to[0] }}px; --ty: {{ icon.to[1] }}px" />
      {%- endfor %}
      {%- for card in folder.cards %}
      <span class="v4-folder__item v4-folder__paper{% if card.hidden %} v4-folder__paper--tucked{% endif %}"
            style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}; --fx: {{ card.from[0] }}px; --fy: {{ card.from[1] }}px; --tx: {{ card.to[0] }}px; --ty: {{ card.to[1] }}px">
        <span class="v4-folder__paper-title">{{ card.title }}</span>
        <span class="v4-folder__paper-text">{{ card.text }}</span>
      </span>
      {%- endfor %}
    </span>

    <img class="v4-folder__still" src="{{ folder.still.src }}" alt=""
         style="left: {{ folder.still.x }}px; width: {{ folder.still.w }}px" />

    <span class="v4-folder__front"
          style="left: {{ folder.front.x }}px; top: {{ folder.front.y }}px; width: {{ folder.front.w }}px; height: {{ folder.front.h }}px; --flap: path('{{ folder.front.path }}'); --flap-art: url('{{ folder.front.src }}')"></span>
  </button>
  <figcaption>{{ folder.label }}</figcaption>
</figure>
